      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8746096::page::005"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The strength gains from incremental Al2O3 addition are accompanied by a slight sacrifice in compressive plasticity.",
